--- !u!114 &2126353166
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2126353164}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8138bc188593f040ba03435cd1258c1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialMessages:
  - Ok Human lets see if you have what it takes to be a shopkeeper. Head to the right.
  - In order to sell anything you will need to place the items in your store. Be
    careful you don't place too many or the customers may not be able to afford them.
  - "Look at you, making progress! Almost makes me think you\u2019re worth the effort.
    Now go open the door and let some customers in."
  - Once that slime goes up to the pedestal you can haggle with them. Try to get
    a good deal but be careful not to upsell them too hard or they won't buy anything.
  - Not bad. Don't be afraid to tell the stingy customers to get lost. Head to the
    right when you are ready.
  - This is a bargain bin. You can sell many items in bulk using these but you will
    have to offer a discount on all the items. Place an item inside the bin.
  - Good, I would avoid putting your most valuable items on sale. Use those bins
    to store your worthless junk.
  - Watch out for thieves, they will steal your items if you don't pay attention.
  - Never hesitate to punish those dirty shoplifters. Good work, keep going.
  - Some items will be more valuable depending on the week. Items in a red outline
    will sell for more, while items with a blue outline will sell for less. Try placing
    a red item.
  - Interact with that cauldron and you will be able to rearange your store's layout.
    Pedestals near windows will be visted more often. Try placing a pedestal near
    that window.
  - Fine work, that's all I have to teach you. Make sure you set your shop up before
    you open it to customers alright?
  tutorialAlternateMessages:
  - 
  - You placed too many items moron, pick them up and place less this time.
  - Open the door already! Or is that beyond your skill set?
  - What are you being shy for? Go talk to the slime already.
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Oh wow they got away that's so embarrassing. Well whatever, keep going.
  - Oh wow they got away that's so embarrassing. Well whatever, keep going.
  - Oh wow they got away that's so embarrassing. Well whatever, keep going.
